sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant App as Desktop app
    participant Loc as Local store
    participant API as Backend
    U->>App: type a message
    App->>Loc: write optimistically, mark pending
    App-->>U: shows immediately
    App->>API: send
    alt streaming response
        loop tokens
            API-->>App: token
            App->>Loc: append to the draft turn
            App-->>U: render incrementally
        end
        App->>Loc: mark the turn complete
    else connection drops mid-stream
        App->>Loc: keep the partial turn
        App->>API: reconnect and resume from the last offset
        Note over App,Loc: local state is the source of truth for what the user can see
    end
